body:
@johnletey What do you think about altering the `style` option instead of using a new key, so that `style` can accept

- A style string "bold dimmed red"

- An array with something like

  ```typescript
  style = Array<{
    match?: {
      name: string, // The name of the environment variable
      eq: string,  // Equals this string
    },
    style: string,  // Apply this style if match is absent or is matched
  }>
  ```
